+*   **Memory Complexity**: $O(V)$ to store the occupied positions and the resulting mesh data.
+*   **Measured Performance**: 4096 cubes rendered at ~60 FPS on the author's system [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Strengths**:
+    *   Significantly reduces vertex count and draw calls by eliminating internal faces.
